{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1557675-night-horrors-onyx-prey-collection-of-forum-created-monsters","id":1557675,"title":"Night Horrors: Onyx Prey (Collection of Forum created Monsters)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-01-16T07:00:29-08:00","id":1557675,"title":"Night Horrors: Onyx Prey (Collection of Forum created Monsters)","content":"So, I scoured the forums to collect the various monsters and monster ideas people have cooked up, both Official writers posting their visions (looking at Acrozatarim and his many contributions) and fan creations.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UYZJ3uS5eXk9cLtVBLNtqbbbQQg7NSMK\" target=\"_blank\">Google Drive Link to 1 and 2 column versions</a><br /> <br /> Limits: I didn't collect everything, I wanted most everything here to<br /> a) be drag and drop, or expand various monsters (eg Spirit creation rules) - There are many interesting ideas and half finished monsters that I decided to skip over.<br /> b) fit the design style of Forsaken in general, and for certain monsters (Pangaeans for example) basing off the Official writers design formats as presented.<br /> c) be a collection of monsters and unified by concepts, rather than design docs for whole settings, or copy/pastes of peoples works.<br /> d) I didn't include anything already in 12 days of wolfmas, I'm pretty sure. So go check that out too for more monsters.<br /> <br /> I broke these rules in some parts, mostly where somethings captured me strongly enough, or where an Official writer's (cough Acrozatarim cough) work was posted and I wanted to collect it all in this format.<br /> <br /> Everything should be cited, with both an author and an original post link.<br /> <br /> The doc is not immune to change, if you want something removed let me know, either in DM or comment below, along with link showing you being the source of the concept. I am also available on discord, under the same name. <br /> <br /> If you feel something has been unjustly skipped, either your own or someone else's, let me know, again via DM/post with a link to the post covering the thing in question. I cannot guaruntee I will add everything requested. I will let you know why or why not, though some of it might just be vibes based - there are a fair few &quot;alternate shifters&quot; posts, and I was pretty restrictive on these to fit the design intent of not being Uratha with a different coat of paint (tribes, auspices, renown, etc), and yet I kept the squid shifters.<br /> <br /> I am open to posts from other forum sections, I just didn't scour them like I did the WtF forum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29012-poptimist","name":"poptimist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29012_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-04-14T14:49:42-07:00","id":1559418,"title":"","content":"This is really cool, seeing all of the werewolf stuff we\u2019ve collectively worked on over the years compiled into one place. No complaints on my end here <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name